[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0010","text":"哦，在玩呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0020","text":"要吃点什么东西吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0030","text":"嗯——\n在那之前，我有点想玩"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0040","text":"好好好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0050","text":"喂——金鱼—\n别想着逃了—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0060","text":"……要不要捞得温柔一点？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0070","text":"诶……\n樋口，你捞了几条？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0080","text":"谁知道呢，没数\n……不会分给你的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0090","text":"诶——？\n一条……不，两条"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000300_03_0100","text":"……一条\n剩下的你自己加油吧"}]
